# Costume Closet: "Whenever a modified creature you control leaves the battlefield" looks back (CR 603.10a, 700.9). Bot2's Pest Control
# destroys every nonland permanent with mana value 1 or less at once: Bot1's Ornithopter with Paradise Mantle attached and its Memnite
# enchanted by Bot1's Holy Strength go to the graveyard together with the Equipment and the Aura. Each creature was modified as it last
# existed, so the Closet (mana value 2, still there) triggers twice and has four counters.

